  "job_B14.32_20251003_114311": {
    "text": "Nor\u00f0hymbra preosta lagu.\nGyf hwa \u00e6nigum preoste \u00e6nig woh beode, beon ealle geferan mid biscopes filste georne ymbe \u00fea bote &\nAnd Godes forboda we forbeoda\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig preost o\u00f0re cirican na\u00f0er ne gebicg\u00e6 ne ge\u00feicg\u00e6, buton\n& gif hit \u00e6nig preost elles gedo, \u00feolige his wur\u00f0scipes & geferena freondscipes & he nahwar ne\n& gilde se \u00fee woh dide XX or \u00feam biscope, XII or \u00feam preoste, \u00fee he of his circan asette, XII or\n& \u00e6lc preost finde him XII festermen, \u00fe\u00e6t he preostlage wille healdan mid rihte.\nAnd gif hwilc preost agilte & he ofer biscopes gebod m\u00e6ssige, gilde for \u00f0am gebode XX or, & \u00fear to\nGif preost biscopes agen geban forbuge, gilde XX or.\nGif preost dom to l\u00e6wedum sceote, \u00fee he to gehadedum scolde, gilde XX or.\nGif preost arcediacones geban forbuge, gilde XII or.\nGif preost scildig sy & he ofer arcediacones gebod m\u00e6ssige, gilde XII or.\nGif preost fulluhtes o\u00f0\u00f0e scriftes forwyrne, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t mid XII or & huru wi\u00f0 God \u00feingige georne.\nGif preost to rihtes timan crisman ne fecce, gilde XII or.\n\u00c6ghwilc cild sy, we l\u00e6ra\u00f0, gefullod binnon nigon nihton, be wite VI or.\n& gif h\u00e6\u00feen cild binnon IX nihton \u00feurh gimeliste forfaren sy, betan for Gode buton worldwite; & gif\nGif preost folce miswissige \u00e6t freolse o\u00f0\u00f0e f\u00e6stene, bete wi\u00f0 God & gilde XII or.\nGif preost on unriht ut of scire had begite, gilde XII or, & diacon VI or; & \u00feolian his hades, buton\nGif preost on unhalgodon huse m\u00e6ssige, gilde XII or.\nGif preost buton gehalgedon weofode m\u00e6ssige, gilde XII or.\nGif preost on treowenan calice husl gehalgige, XII or.\nGif preost buton wine m\u00e6ssige, gilde XII or.\nGif preost husl forgime, gilde XII or.\nGif preost anes d\u00e6ges m\u00e6ssige oftor \u00feonne \u00f0riwa, gilde XII or.\nGif man ciricgri\u00f0 abrece, bete be circan m\u00e6\u00f0e & be \u00feam \u00fee hire mund sy.\nGif man mid cirican mangie, bete be lahslite.\nGif man cirican nyd\u00feeowige, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t be lahslihte.\nGif man preost of circan on unriht utige, bete \u00fe\u00e6t be lahslite.\nGif man preost gewundige, gebete man \u00fea wyndlan & biscope to weofodbote for his hade sille XII or;\nGif man preost ofslea, forgilde man hine be fullan were & biscope feower & XX or to weofodbote; \u00e6t\nGif preost circan miswur\u00f0ige, \u00fee eal his wur\u00f0scipe of sceal arisan, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t.\nGif preost on circan ungedafenlice \u00feingc gelogige, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t.\nGif preost ciric\u00feingc utige, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t.\nGif preost silfwilles \u00fea circan forl\u00e6te, \u00f0e he to gehadod w\u00e6s, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t.\nGif preost o\u00f0erne forseo o\u00f0\u00f0e gebismrige mid worde o\u00f0\u00f0e mid weorce, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t.\nGif preost wi\u00f0 o\u00f0erne gefeohte, bete him & biscope.\nGif preost o\u00f0rum on unriht on fultume beo, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t.\nGif preost o\u00f0rum rihtes fultumes forwyrne, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t.\nGif preost o\u00f0erne unwarnode l\u00e6te \u00fe\u00e6s, \u00fee he wite, \u00fe\u00e6t him hearmian wille, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t.\nGif preost sceare misgime beardes o\u00f0\u00f0e feaxes, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t.\nGif preost cwenan forl\u00e6te & o\u00f0re nime, anathema sit.\nGif preost on gesetne timan tida ne ringe o\u00f0\u00f0e tida ne singe, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t.\nGif preost mid w\u00e6pnum innan circan cume, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t.\nGif preost misendebirde ciriclice gear\u00feenunga, d\u00e6ges o\u00f0\u00f0e nihtes, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t.\nGif preost ordol misfadige, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t.\nGif preost searwa\u00f0 bewinde, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t.\nGif preost oferdruncen lufige o\u00f0\u00f0e gliman o\u00f0\u00f0e ealascop wur\u00f0e, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t.\nGif preost forhele, hw\u00e6t on his scriftscire betweox mannum to unrihte rixige, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t.\nGif preost geargerihta unmynegode l\u00e6te, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t.\nGif preost sino\u00f0 forbuge, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t.\nGif preost to rihte gebugan nelle, ac ongean biscopes ger\u00e6dnesse wi\u00f0erige, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t o\u00f0\u00f0e beo he\nGif hwa Godes lage o\u00f0\u00f0e folclage wirde, gebete hit georne.\nEalle we sculon \u00e6nne God wur\u00f0ian & lufian & \u00e6nne Cristendom georne healdan & \u00e6lcne h\u00e6\u00feendom\nGif \u00feonne \u00e6ni man agiten wur\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nigne h\u00e6\u00f0enscipe heonan for\u00f0 dreoge o\u00f0\u00f0e on blot o\u00f0\u00f0e on\nGif hit sy elles landagende man, gilde VI healfmarc, healf Criste & healf landrican.\nGif hit si f\u00e6rbena, gilde XII or.\nGif cyninges \u00feegn \u00e6tsace, \u00feonne nemne man him XII, and nime his maga XII & XII wallerwente; & gif\nGif landagende man \u00e6tsace, \u00feonne nemne man him his gelican ealswa micel wente swa cyninges\nGif cyrlisc man \u00e6ts\u00e6ce, \u00feonne nemne man him his gelicena ealswa micel wente swa \u00f0am o\u00f0rum; gif\nGif fri\u00f0geard sy on hw\u00e6s lande abuton stan o\u00f0\u00f0e treow o\u00f0\u00f0e wille o\u00f0\u00f0e swilces \u00e6nigge fleard, \u00feonne\n& gif se landrica nelle to steore filstan, \u00feonne habbe Crist & cyningc \u00fea bote.\nSunnand\u00e6ges cypingc we forbeoda\u00f0 \u00e6ghwar & \u00e6lc folcgemot & \u00e6lc weorc & \u00e6lce lade \u00e6g\u00f0er ge on\nSe \u00fee \u00e6nig \u00feissa do, gilde wite: friman XII or, \u00f0eowman \u00f0a hyde; buton wegferende, \u00fea moton for\nSe \u00fee freols o\u00f0\u00f0e riht f\u00e6sten brece, gilde wite XII or.\n& we willa\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc Romp\u00e6ni beo gel\u00e6st be Petres m\u00e6ssan to \u00f0am bisceopstole.\n& we willa\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t man namige on \u00e6lcon w\u00e6pengetace II triwe \u00feegnas & \u00e6nne m\u00e6ssepreost, \u00fe\u00e6t hi hit\nGif cyninges \u00feegn o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00e6nig landrica hit forh\u00e6bbe, gilde X healfmarc, healf Criste healf cynge.\nGif hwilc tunesman \u00e6nigne p\u00e6nig forhele o\u00f0\u00f0e forh\u00e6bbe, gilde se landrica \u00feone p\u00e6nig & nime \u00e6nne\nGif hwa teo\u00f0inge forhealde & he sy cyninges \u00feegn, gilde X healfmarc, landagende VI healfmarc, ceorl\nAnd we forbeoda\u00f0 on Godes forbode, \u00fe\u00e6t nan man na ma wifa n\u00e6bbe buton I; & seo beo mid rihte\n& \u00fe\u00e6t nan man ne wifige on neahsibban men \u00feonne wi\u00f0utan \u00feam IIII cneowe; ne nan man on his\n& gif hit hwa gedo, nabbe he Godes mildse, buton he geswice & bete, swa biscop get\u00e6ce.\nGif he \u00feonne on \u00f0am unrihte geendige, \u00feolige he cl\u00e6nes legeres & Godes mildse.\nGif hwa wi\u00f0 nunnan forlicge, sy \u00e6g\u00f0er his weres scildig, ge he ge heo.\n& gif hi on \u00f0am geendigan buton geswicennesse, \u00feolian cl\u00e6nes legeres & Godes mildse.\nGif hwa his riht\u00e6we lifigende forl\u00e6te & on o\u00f0ran wife on unriht gewifige, n\u00e6bbe he Godes myldse,\nAc healde gehwa mid rihte his \u00e6we \u00fea hwile \u00fee heo libbe; buton \u00fe\u00e6t gewur\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t hi buta geceosan be\nGif \u00e6nig man heonan for\u00f0 rihte laga wyrde, gebete hit georne.\nEalle we sculon \u00e6nne God lufian & wur\u00f0ian & \u00e6nne Cristendom georne healdan & \u00e6lcne h\u00e6\u00f0endom\n& we willa\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t landceap & lahceap & witword & getrywe gewitnes & riht dom & fulloc &\nSit nomen Domini benedictum ex hoc nunc et usque in seculum.",
